-- Two more review sets, drawn by scripts/ai/sample.ts (the parameters and the
-- population's and set's proportions are in scripts/ai/sets/<name>.json).
-- strat-1000 is a stratified random sample of the notes on posts still on X,
-- not counting our notewriter's: 500 rated helpful and 500 not helpful (3.5%
-- of the population), no notewriter above 50 in either, seed 1. It is for
-- the models to review, so their taste-failure rate can be weighted back to
-- the population. label-next-60 is 60 notes of strat-1000 no labeller had
-- judged, 30 helpful and 30 not helpful, for the labellers next, so the
-- models' sensitivity and specificity are measured on a random sample too.
-- shared-100 stays as it was.

